<h1 data-copy-en="Audrey" data-copy-zh="Audrey">Audrey</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Audrey’s garden schedule, nature lesson, Rainheart gift and three crafted-gift upgrades." data-copy-zh="查找Audrey的花园行程、自然课程、雨心插条及三项手工礼物升级。">Find Audrey’s garden schedule, nature lesson, Rainheart gift and three crafted-gift upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Sirena_Isle_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Audrey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Sunset_Walk_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Garden_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Seven-Round_Battle_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_and_Recruiting_Audrey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Audrey — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/audrey.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Audrey — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/audrey.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Audrey — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Audrey becomes available after the normal Dungeon floor 35 encounter. Her later content centers on the garden, a nature lesson, resort visits and crafted-gift training upgrades.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>After she joins, find her in Garden daily 08:00–18:00, except when away on an arranged vacation.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Garden Walk is available at Friend 100,09:00–16:00:120 min/25 Energy, once. Her personal heart-to-heart is the resort sunset walk rather than a separate home conversation chain.</p><p>At Romantic 800/Mystic 60 she can teach Nature's Embrace:350 min/180 Energy/100 Calm, learned once, subject to its content lock.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Special-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Living_Gift_and_Rainheart_Cuttings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Living Gift</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">In Love (3000); 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Garden; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Garden Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Garden; Friend (100); 09:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 25 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nature's Embrace</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Garden; Romantic (800); Mystic 60; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">350 min; 180 Energy; 100 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Nature's Embrace once</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Crafted-gift scene</th><th scope="col">Where / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Training upgraded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Roots That Can Leave</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Garden; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Garden Walk with Audrey</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Hexbound Rose Sachet</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Cowgirl</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">One Light, Every Color</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Garden; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Sunset Walk with Audrey</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Oral</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Shape in the Dark</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Garden; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Void-Kissed Charm</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Doggie</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At In Love 3000, A Living Gift gives Rainheart Cuttings once,20 min, from the home garden 08:00–18:00. This specimen is useful for Willow; it cannot be collected again merely by discarding it.</p><p>Three crafted gifts upgrade her training at In Love 3000, while home 08:00–18:00. Each consumes one gift, takes 0 min and completes once. Each upgrade adds 50% to her income multiplier and doubles that training’s experience. The cowgirl gift requires her Garden Walk; the oral gift requires the resort sunset walk.</p><p>She has the current resort buffet, relaxation, private beach time, spa and sunset-walk activities. The walk starts at the beach 17:00–20:00,60 min, once/day; resort scheduling replaces the home garden while she is away.</p><p>Favorite stats are Mystic, Perception, Intelligence. Learning Inner Peace improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If a gift action is missing, check the exact crafted consumable and its date/conversation prerequisite.</li><li>Rainheart requires In Love 3000 and Audrey actually home; the ordinary Garden Walk date does not award that specimen.</li><li>Already learned Nature’s Embrace is removed from the lesson menu.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-willow.html">Willow’s specimens</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Staff and training</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Sirena_Isle_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Audrey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Sunset_Walk_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Garden_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Seven-Round_Battle_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_and_Recruiting_Audrey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Audrey 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/audrey.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Audrey 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/audrey.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Audrey 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Audrey在普通地下城第35层遭遇后开放。后续内容围绕花园、自然课程、度假及手工礼物训练升级展开。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>加入后，每天08:00–18:00在花园；安排度假时会暂时离开。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>庭园漫步要求朋友100、09:00–16:00，消耗120分钟、25精力，仅一次。她的个人交心在度假日落散步中进行，没有另一条青楼内交心链。</p><p>浪漫感800、神秘60可学习自然之拥，350分钟、180精力、100镇定，仅一次，另须满足内容权限。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Special-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Living_Gift_and_Rainheart_Cuttings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">一份鲜活的礼物</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">恋爱中（3000好感）；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">花园；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庭园漫步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">花园；朋友（100好感）；09:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；25精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自然之拥</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">花园；浪漫感（800好感）；神秘60；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">350分钟；180精力；100镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习自然之拥，仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">手工礼物事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">升级训练</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">扎根亦能远行</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">花园；08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；与Audrey漫步花园</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付咒缚玫瑰香囊×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">女上位</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一束光，万般色彩</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">花园；08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；和 Audrey 的日落散步</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付棱彩法术胸针×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">口交</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">黑暗中的形态</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">花园；08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付虚吻护符×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">后入式</td></tr></tbody></table><p>恋爱中3000可在青楼花园08:00–18:00进行一份鲜活的礼物，20分钟，获得雨心插条，仅一次，可交给Willow；丢弃后不会因此重新赠送。</p><p>三件手工礼物可在恋爱中3000、留在青楼08:00–18:00时升级训练。每项交付一件礼物、0分钟、仅一次；收入倍率每项增加50%，对应训练获得双倍经验。女上位升级需完成花园散步，口交升级需完成度假日落散步。</p><p>度假时可用餐、海滩休息、享受私密时光、水疗及日落散步。散步在海滩17:00–20:00开始，60分钟，每天一次；度假行程会替代青楼花园行程。</p><p>偏好的属性为神秘、感知、智力。学会内心平静可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>礼物行动不出现时，检查指定消耗品及对应约会、交心是否完成。</li><li>雨心插条要求恋爱中3000，且Audrey实际留在青楼；普通花园约会不会赠送该标本。</li><li>学会自然之拥后，课程会从菜单消失。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="character-willow.html">Willow的标本</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">手工礼物</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假活动</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">员工与训练</a></li></ul></section>
